Chat: {
	DormantEyeOpens: The lid splits. Something under the stone is awake.
	DormantEyeDown: The Dormant Eye has been cracked open.
	KeeperPhase2: The shell splits. The eye will not close again.
	KeeperPhase3: Something inside the Keeper tears open.
	WeaverPhase2: The Weaver drives four legs into the ground and hides behind its own cloth.
	WeaverPhase3: The anchors come loose. The Weaver stops weaving and starts running.
	FirstKeeperPhase2: The lids grind apart. It has stopped pretending it cannot see you.
	FirstKeeperPhase3: The First Keeper throws away its shell. Nothing is hidden from here.
	BreachBegin: The stone gives way. The Breach is open.
	BreachWave2: The mouths widen. More is coming through.
	BreachWave3: The crack will not hold. Whatever is left is coming now.
	BreachWon: The Breach closes.
	BreachFailed: The Breach seals itself. Nobody was left to hold it open.
}

